          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna sodomi sagaleeso ka Uziani hayyu Yuda tahe, Menahemuni, ilmi Gadi, hayyu Israeli tahe, ganna kud'ani Samaria keesa lafa mohate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni faana Yeroboamu, ilma Nabathi, ka haga ufi jiru ch'ufa worra Israeli ch'ubbu keesa buuse, gula bahe, AABBO Waaqa durati ch'ubbu tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiglath-Pilesari, hayyuuni Ashuru, lafa Israeli had'e, duuba Menahemuni, qarsi kilo kuma sodomi afuri isaa kenne, aka akasiini qarqaarsa isaa argate irre ufi, ta lafaani mohatu, jabeesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemuni beese suni ch'ufa worra dureeyyi irreeni iraa fud'ate, nama ch'ufa qarsi shantama. Jennaani hayyuuni Ashuru kae lafa isati gale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
