        {
          "text": "Gaafa Pekani lafa Israeli mohate, Tiglath-Pilesarini, hayyuuni Ashuru, dira Iyoni fa, ka Abel-Bethi Maakafa, Yanoafa, Kedeshifa, Hazurifa ammalle lafa Gileaditifi ta Galilayatifi ta Naftalile had'e dabsate, worra lafa suni ch'ufa boojie, lafa Ashuruti galche.",
