        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna diddameeso ka Yothamuni, ilmi Uzia hayyu Yuda tahe, Hosheani, ilmi Ela, hayyu Pekati malate ijeese, fulla isa hayyu tahe. ",
          "type": "text",
