          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafi Yothamuni lafa Yuda mohate suni, gaafa AABBO Waaqi qara hayyu Resini ka Shamutifi hayyu Peka ka Israeli, lafa Yuda had'iisaa erge.",
          "type": "text",
